% What this file is for: the BibTeX a user pastes into a paper that uses
% qcx, its integral engines, its solvers, its property analyses or its
% vendored basis-set data.
%
% Where the entries come from: they are a transcription of this
% repository's own citation index (ExternalDocs/CITATIONS.md), which lists
% the published work every algorithm, dataset and fitted constant in the
% tree derives from. The keys are the ones the source comments cite, so a
% key here and a `[Key]` in the code name the same entry.
%
% Only the bibliographic fields the published source states are carried
% here. A field filled in from elsewhere would be a fabricated reference in
% a bibliography, and a public citation file must not carry one.
%
